# Message ids whose content is pinned by claims-manifest.txt. Membership is
# decided by the claim register (a string asserting what the product does,
# does not do, sees, stores, or sends), not by this file's editor. The full
# interface register counts 251 such messages; they join this list as their
# surfaces are extracted.
prefs-dns-system-description
prefs-dns-quad9-description
prefs-tunnel-off-description
prefs-tunnel-imported-description

